  "description": "LiteOrm.DependencyInjection DI 扩展：LiteOrm 的依赖注入与 AOP 集成层。基于 Autofac 与 Castle DynamicProxy，通过 RegisterLiteOrm() 一键注册，支持声明式事务、权限、日志拦截与自动建表。",
  "id": "LiteOrm.DependencyInjection",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-09-05T17:11:43.303Z",
